noPhotos

Alias 	MyD0	D0
Alias	MyD0b	anti-D0

Decay pbarpSystem
  0.5 	MyD0 anti-D0	PHSP;
  0.5 	D0 MyD0b		PHSP;
Enddecay

Decay pbarpSystem0
  0.5 	MyD0 anti-D0	PHSP;
  0.5 	D0 MyD0b		PHSP;
Enddecay

Decay MyD0
  1.0 	K- pi+ pi+ pi- 	PHSP;
Enddecay

Decay MyD0b
  1.0 	K+ pi- pi- pi+ 	PHSP;
Enddecay

End
